#ASSERT `s 236(2) to (5) the directors' report must state that the provision is in force or was in force` `s 236(2) when the directors' report is approved, for a director of the company` (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 236(2) to (5) the directors' report must state that the provision is in force or was in force` `s 236(2) when the directors' report is approved, for a director of the company` NOTHING TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
